Subject: Bi-Factor Model Theory
Message-ID: <R3ttP85XWkk.BQCvQlcTQKcJ@mirt-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/mirt-package/c/R3ttP85XWkk/m/BQCvQlcTQKcJ>
